{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"6c54a28f-9167-4c14-8fe6-46e3a5969727","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The integration issues with Intervals.icu have been fixed, and the root causes and note applicability details have been documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-xZ1V46/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Fixes\n\n1. **Init Endpoint Authenticated POST ([server.py](file:///tmp/h-xZ1V46/server.py), [app.js](file:///tmp/h-xZ1V46/static/app.js))**:\n   - Converted `/api/intervals/auth/init` from `GET` to an authenticated `POST` returning `{\"authorize_url\": \"...\"}` as JSON.\n   - Updated the frontend Connect button to trigger an authenticated `api(\"/api/intervals/auth/init\", { method: \"POST\" })` fetch call carrying the session token from `localStorage`, then navigating via `window.location.assign(res.authorize_url)`.\n2. **Duplicate Scope Elimination ([config.py](file:///tmp/h-xZ1V46/config.py))**:\n   - Changed scopes from `\"ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"` to `\"ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"` because Intervals.icu implies read permissions on write and rejects repeated area names with an invalid request error.\n3. **Token Expiration \u0026 Refresh Removal ([server.py](file:///tmp/h-xZ1V46/server.py))**:\n   - Removed the default 3600-second token TTL and background token refresh thread. Intervals.icu OAuth tokens do not expire or provide refresh tokens.\n   - Implemented lazy revocation handling by checking for HTTP 401 on API calls and clearing the stored token to prompt reconnection.\n4. **Token Exchange Simplification ([server.py](file:///tmp/h-xZ1V46/server.py))**:\n   - Updated [`exchange_code()`](file:///tmp/h-xZ1V46/server.py#L58-L64) to pass only `client_id`, `client_secret`, and `code`.\n","duration_seconds":224.721001,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":297011,"output_tokens":12609,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":1703361,"total_tokens":309620}}}
